.SS "tuple pygments\&.lexers\&.bdd\&.BddLexer\&.step_keywords\fC [static]\fP"
\fBInitial value:\fP.PP
.nf
=  (r'Given|When|Then|Add|And|Feature|Scenario Outline|'
